  "solution": {
    "text": "(a) From figure,<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/Djr7jOTnwC9j_KyyquLbu_JqUqhoVr-OQSeyH17AjIk.original.fullsize.png\"><br><br />Displacement,<br />$\\mathrm{BA}=\\sqrt{(2 \\mathrm{R})^2+(\\pi \\mathrm{R})^2}=\\mathrm{R} \\sqrt{4+\\pi^2}$",
